                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi>, D. F.</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 29, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Received from Mr. J. M. Cardoso de Oliveira, Minister of Brazil, in charge of
                    American interests in Mexico, the check referred to in the foregoing
                    receipt.</p>
